"Anything beyond them is somebody's answer and is never overwritten by a re-"
"run."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_filing_discrepancy__kind
msgid ""
"'Difference is expected' and 'Informational' are findings of neither "
"agreement nor error: a KV is a proper subset of the priznanie, and the VAT "
"base legitimately diverges from účtovná trieda 60. Reported, never flagged."
msgstr ""
"„Rozdiel je očakávaný“ a „Informatívne“ nie sú ani zhoda, ani chyba: "
"KV je vlastnou podmnožinou priznania a základ dane sa oprávnene líši "
"od účtovnej triedy 60. Vykazuje sa, nikdy sa neoznačuje."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cssk_core.view_cssk_filing_discrepancy_form
msgid ""
"A gap in this direction is structural, not an error: the\n"
"                        KV is a proper subset of the priznanie. Only the\n"
"                        opposite direction is impossible, and only that is\n"
"                        flagged."
msgstr ""
"Medzera v tomto smere je štrukturálna, nie chybová: KV je\n vlastnou "
"podmnožinou priznania. Nemožný je len opačný\n smer a označuje sa "
"len ten."

