#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_filing_comparison__finding_count
msgid ""
"Rows that really disagree. A structural gap ('Difference is "
"expected') and an informational row are not counted — they are "
"neither agreement nor error."
msgstr ""
"Riadky, ktoré sa naozaj nezhodujú. Štrukturálna medzera („Rozdiel je "
"očakávaný“) ani informatívny riadok sa nepočítajú — nie sú ani "
"zhodou, ani chybou."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_filing_comparison__open_count
msgid "Findings nobody has answered yet."
msgstr "Zistenia, na ktoré zatiaľ nikto neodpovedal."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_filing_comparison__asked_count
