msgstr "Výsledok"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cssk_core.view_cssk_filing_comparison_form
msgid ""
"The status above is computed from the rows. It says nobody still has "
"to answer anything — not that anybody has looked."
msgstr ""
"Stav vyššie je vypočítaný z riadkov. Hovorí, že už nikto nemusí na "
"nič odpovedať — nie že sa naň niekto pozrel."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cssk_core.view_cssk_filing_comparison_search
