#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:l10n_cssk_core.action_cssk_filing_comparison
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:l10n_cssk_core.menu_cssk_filing_comparison_list
msgid "Comparisons"
msgstr "Porovnania"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,help:l10n_cssk_core.action_cssk_filing_comparison
msgid "No comparison has been run yet."
msgstr "Zatiaľ nebolo spustené žiadne porovnanie."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,help:l10n_cssk_core.action_cssk_filing_comparison
msgid ""
"One entry per migrated filing put beside what the ledger produces "
"for the same period. The status is computed from the rows, so this "
"answers \"how much of the migration landed\" without opening any of "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Jeden záznam na každé migrované podanie postavené vedľa toho, čo pre "
"rovnaké obdobie produkuje účtovníctvo. Stav sa počíta z riadkov, "
"takže odpovedá na otázku „koľko z migrácie sa podarilo“ bez toho, "
"aby ste ktorýkoľvek z nich otvorili."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:l10n_cssk_core.menu_cssk_filing_discrepancy
msgid "Rows to review"
msgstr "Riadky na posúdenie"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_core/models/cssk_statement_account_map.py:0
msgid ""
"Account %s is mapped for any balance AND for one side. Use either one 'any "
"balance' mapping, or a debit and/or a credit mapping."
msgstr ""
"Účet %s je namapovaný pre akýkoľvek zostatok A ZÁROVEŇ pre jednu stranu. "
"Použite buď jedno mapovanie „akýkoľvek zostatok“, alebo debetné a/alebo "
"kreditné mapovanie."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:l10n_cssk_core.constraint_cssk_statement_account_map_company_account_side_uniq
msgid "An account can be mapped only once per balance side."
msgstr "Účet možno namapovať len raz pre každú stranu zostatku."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_cssk_core.selection__cssk_statement_account_map__balance_side__any
msgid "Any balance"
msgstr "Akýkoľvek zostatok"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_statement_account_map__balance_side
msgid ""
"Any balance: always reported under the code.\n"
"Debit / credit balance only: reported under the code only when the account's balance at the period end has that sign (an overdrawn bank account reported as a bank loan); otherwise it keeps its own code. Applies to balance-sheet balances only."
msgstr ""
"Akýkoľvek zostatok: účet sa vždy vykazuje pod týmto kódom.\n"
"Len debetný / kreditný zostatok: pod týmto kódom sa vykazuje, len ak má zostatok účtu ku koncu obdobia toto znamienko (prečerpaný bankový účet vykázaný ako bankový úver); inak si ponecháva vlastný kód. Platí len pre zostatky v súvahe."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_statement_account_map__balance_side
msgid "Balance Side"
msgstr "Strana zostatku"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_cssk_core.selection__cssk_statement_account_map__balance_side__credit
msgid "Credit balance only"
msgstr "Len kreditný zostatok"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_cssk_core.selection__cssk_statement_account_map__balance_side__debit
msgid "Debit balance only"
msgstr "Len debetný zostatok"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cssk_core.cssk_statement_account_map_view_search
msgid "Depends on balance side"
msgstr "Závisí od strany zostatku"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:l10n_cssk_core.cssk_statement_account_map_action
msgid "Report an account under another code"
msgstr "Vykázať účet pod iným kódom"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_statement_account_map__reported_code
msgid "Reported Code"
msgstr "Vykazovaný kód"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.actions.act_window,name:l10n_cssk_core.cssk_statement_account_map_action
#: model:ir.model,name:l10n_cssk_core.model_cssk_statement_account_map
#: model:ir.ui.menu,name:l10n_cssk_core.menu_cssk_statement_account_map
msgid "Statement account mapping"
msgstr "Mapovanie účtov do výkazov"

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:l10n_cssk_core.cssk_statement_account_map_action
msgid ""
"Statutory statements read balances by the account codes their\n"
"               rows name. An account of your own chart that no row names —\n"
"               an analytic carried over from another system — lands on no row.\n"
"               Map it to the code the form expects, for any balance or only\n"
"               for a debit or credit balance at the period end."
msgstr ""
"Zákonné výkazy čítajú zostatky podľa kódov účtov, ktoré uvádzajú ich riadky."
" Účet vašej účtovej osnovy, ktorý žiadny riadok neuvádza — analytika "
"prenesená z iného systému — nepatrí do žiadneho riadku. Namapujte ho na kód,"
" ktorý tlačivo očakáva, pre akýkoľvek zostatok alebo len pre debetný či "
"kreditný zostatok ku koncu obdobia."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_statement_account_map__reported_code
msgid ""
"The account code the statutory statements read this account as — a code the "
"form's rows name, e.g. 461200 for a short-term bank loan on the Slovak Úč "
"POD."
msgstr ""
"Kód účtu, pod ktorým zákonné výkazy tento účet čítajú — kód, ktorý uvádzajú "
"riadky tlačiva, napr. 461200 pre krátkodobý bankový úver na slovenskom Úč "
"POD."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_core/models/cssk_statement_account_map.py:0
msgid ""
"The reported code must be a plain account code, without spaces, commas, "
"signs or tag operators."
msgstr ""
"Vykazovaný kód musí byť samotný kód účtu, bez medzier, čiarok, znamienok a "
"operátorov značiek."

#. module: l10n_cssk_core
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_cssk_core.field_cssk_statement_account_map__account_id
msgid "Account"
msgstr "Účet"
